id=picoet-enhance
name=PicoET-Enhance
version=2.1.0
versionCode=15
author=PicoFacialBridge
description=Runtime eye-tracking enhancement by ptrace injection: opens the service-local per-eye gate and enables genuine per-eye gaze. Ships no PICO bytes, writes no system file and no persistent property; ro.pxr.externalfunc is never touched. Action toggles enhanced (dual/on) and normal (off/off). Commands: picoet.sh dual | off | toggle | status.
